      "title": "Final transmission",
      "ending": true,
      "text": "Earth received Pathfinder’s last data on September 27, 1997. By then, the mission had sent Earth 2.3 billion bits of information. The final transmission gives us Sojourner’s last known position. What happened to the rover after contact ended is uncertain.",
